How many rows does this query count?

```sql
CREATE TABLE visit (patient TEXT, allergy TEXT);
INSERT INTO visit VALUES
  ('Ana', 'penicillin'), ('Ben', NULL), ('Chidi', 'latex'),
  ('Dana', NULL), ('Eun', 'pollen');
SELECT count(*) FROM visit WHERE allergy NOT IN ('latex', 'pollen');
```

In SQLite, what does this program print? Write the lines separated by single spaces.

```sql
CREATE TABLE t (x INTEGER);
INSERT INTO t VALUES (3), (NULL), (1), (2);
SELECT coalesce(x, 0) FROM t ORDER BY x DESC;
```
